{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"su-resistance","title":"鲁肃劝孙权拒曹","order":9597,"accounts":[{"id":"su-resistance-account-1","label":"记载","text":"鲁肃劝孙权不要采纳迎曹之议，并劝其召回周瑜。","evidence":["su-advice","su-recall"]},{"id":"zhouyu-e-o046a-account","label":"《周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传》正文","text":"曹操欲东时：孙权议迎曹鲁肃追孙权宇下","evidence":["zhouyu-e-o046a-q"]},{"id":"zhouyu-a-o047-judgment","label":null,"text":"曹操欲东时：鲁肃称自己可迎曹而孙权迎曹无归所，劝勿用迎曹之议。","evidence":["zhouyu-q-o047-judgment"]},{"id":"zhouyu-e-o048a-account","label":"《周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传》正文","text":"议拒曹时：孙权赞鲁肃开大计","evidence":["zhouyu-e-o048a-q"]},{"id":"zhouyu-a-p007-suresistance-priority","label":"裴松之论","text":"裴松之认为拒曹本谋实始鲁肃，周瑜还自鄱阳与肃暗同，批评略去鲁肃首倡。","evidence":["zhouyu-q-p007-suresistance-priority"]}],"participants":[{"person":"lu-su","role":"劝拒曹、召周瑜","evidence":["su-advice","su-recall"]},{"person":"sun-quan","role":"听取劝说","evidence":["su-advice"]},{"person":"zhou-yu","role":"被建议召回","evidence":["su-recall"]}],"place":{"text":"原段未明示会谈地点","evidence":["su-advice"]},"time":{"label":"建安十三年（208）","year":208,"precision":"year","basis":"年次承接本篇建安十三年记事，现代注释释为公元 208 年；此条未记具体月日。","evidence":["year-original","year-modern","zhou-year","zhou-year-modern","meeting-zhou","su-advice"]}}],"persons":[{"id":"lu-su","name":"鲁肃","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"sun-quan","name":"孙权","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"zhou-yu","name":"周瑜","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"meeting-zhou","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-df9e8a2d1c2855c608f2","quote":"时刘备为曹公所破，欲引南渡江；与鲁肃遇于当阳，遂共图计。因进住夏口，遣诸葛亮诣权。权遂遣瑜及程普等，与备并力逆曹公，遇于赤壁。","layer":"original","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":62,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":63,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"su-advice","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-472e77c03c5b35774219","quote":"权知其意，执肃手曰：“卿欲何言？”肃对曰：“向察众人之议〖5〗，专欲误将军：不足与图大事。今肃可迎操耳，如将军，不可也。何以言之？今肃迎操，操当以肃还付乡党〖6〗；品其名位，犹不失下曹从事〖7〗，乘犊车〖8〗，从吏卒，交游士林：累官故不失州郡也〖9〗。将军迎操，欲安所归〖10〗？愿早定大计，莫用众人之议也！”","layer":"original","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":232,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":155,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"su-recall","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-6e5753512f06b6a12b33","quote":"时周瑜受使至鄱阳〖12〗，肃劝追召瑜还。","layer":"original","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":233,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":45,"end":65,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"year-modern","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-888495d8be7766faf20c","quote":"十三年：建安十三年（公元 208）。","layer":"modern","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":666,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-0bae348fdb687025113d","start":3,"end":21,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"year-original","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-4bcffcc4ee709a4e5ea3","quote":"十三年春正月〖1〗，公还邺。","layer":"original","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":661,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":14,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhou-year","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-3661896c106f1817bf4b","quote":"十三年春〖6〗，权讨江夏，瑜为前部大督〖7〗。其年九月，曹公入荆州，刘琮举众降。","layer":"original","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":34,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":40,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhou-year-modern","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-63f47c62fde80b3a0132","quote":"十三年：建安十三年（公元 208）。","layer":"modern","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":43,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-8f109f42647e5ee8d831","start":3,"end":21,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhouyu-e-o046a-q","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-0cadf1fbf69f6633abfe","layer":"original","quote":"会权得曹公欲东之问〖1〗，与诸将议。皆劝权迎之〖2〗，而肃独不言。权起更衣〖3〗，肃追于宇下〖4〗。","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":231,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":50,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhouyu-e-o048a-q","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-6e5753512f06b6a12b33","layer":"original","quote":"权叹息曰：“此诸人持议，甚失孤望！今卿廓开大计〖11〗，正与孤同：此天以卿赐我也！”﹝一﹞时周瑜受使至鄱阳〖12〗，肃劝追召瑜还。","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":233,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":65,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhouyu-q-o047-judgment","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-472e77c03c5b35774219","layer":"original","quote":"权知其意，执肃手曰：“卿欲何言？”肃对曰：“向察众人之议〖5〗，专欲误将军：不足与图大事。今肃可迎操耳，如将军，不可也。何以言之？今肃迎操，操当以肃还付乡党〖6〗；品其名位，犹不失下曹从事〖7〗，乘犊车〖8〗，从吏卒，交游士林：累官故不失州郡也〖9〗。将军迎操，欲安所归〖10〗？愿早定大计，莫用众人之议也！”","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":232,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":155,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhouyu-q-p007-suresistance-priority","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-693763015f3a5c900fb2","layer":"pei","quote":"臣松之以为：建计拒曹公，实始鲁肃。于时周瑜使鄱阳，肃劝权呼瑜；瑜使鄱阳还，但与肃暗同，故能共成大勋。本传直云，权延见群下，问以计策，瑜摆拨众人之议，独言抗拒之计；了不云肃先有谋，殆为攘肃之善也。","attribution":"裴松之论","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":61,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-19fd8eb85b7b2ca85f96","start":315,"end":412,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
